    [Test]Extend MRV2 DSpark and DFlash unit coverage (#18156)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add 38 parameterized unit-test cases across three existing test files
    for the MRV2 DSpark/DFlash speculators and DFlash ACL graph manager. The
    tests execute the Ascend Python logic while mocking device execution and
    upstream model/graph boundaries.
    
    - Check DSpark LM-head collective capacity, zero padding, trimmed
    logits, and rejection of oversized batches before collective execution.
    - Validate loaded draft KV-group mappings and reject incompatible local
    context features before writing KV; check that sampling uses the
    replicated backbone output.
    - Check DFlash padded query metadata, draft-layer filtering, int32 slot
    mappings, separate physical/kernel block sizes, and profiling DP-state
    handling.
    - Check eager draft graph selection, actual captured token sizes,
    graph-manager ownership, and metadata resolution/replay/update ordering
    for updatable graphs.
    
    Only tests are changed. No production behavior is modified.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    ```bash
    python -m coverage run --rcfile=/dev/null --branch \
      --include='*/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/dspark/speculator.py,*/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/dflash/speculator.py,*/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/dflash/aclgraph.py' \
      -m pytest -q \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dflash2_v2.py \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_valid_kv_lengths.py \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_mla_dspark.py \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_speculator.py \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_graph_contract.py \
      tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_model_loading.py \
      tests/ut/worker/test_dcp_speculator_metadata_v2.py \
      tests/ut/worker/v2/test_spec_decode.py \
      tests/ut/worker/test_model_runner_v2_finegrained_tp.py \
      tests/ut/worker/test_pcp_manager_v2.py \
      tests/ut/worker/v2/test_speculator.py
    python -m coverage report --rcfile=/dev/null -m
    
    ruff check tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dflash2_v2.py tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_speculator.py tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_graph_contract.py
    ruff format --check tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dflash2_v2.py tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_speculator.py tests/ut/spec_decode/test_dspark_graph_contract.py
    git diff --check
    ```
    
